Z||000000||Seanh||06-18-2001||07:03 PM||||Well, I have decided, since the front suspension system and steering system were so badly damaged in last weekends accident, I am going to completly rebuild and redo the entire front end while I have it apart. I just placed an order with the Fiero Store for all, well most, of my parts. Heres what I'll be doing:<BR>Rebuilt Rack and Pinion<BR>New poly R&P mounting bushings<BR>New poly Sway bar bushings<BR>Poly sway bar end link kit<BR>New upper and lower ball joints<BR>Poly outter tie rod dust boots<BR>Ploy front contol arm bushing kit (Fiero Store)<BR>New inner and outter front wheel bearings<BR>Turn rotors, and rebuilt & paint calipers<BR>New brake pads<P>While I have everything apart, I'm going to paint it all also. Can't wait to get all this done. At this time the car has the steering rack & pinion removed. I'm going to get started removing the sway bar, and contol arms tonight so I can rebush them once my order from the Fiero Store gets here.<P>I will be sure to post some before and after picts once this is completeled. I don't have a digital camera yet, so I won't be able to post until I get the film developed. Anyway, just wanted to let everyone know who might be interested. ||||reg||1
